 the coefficient of $x$, so the required slope is $4$.\n\nRewrite the choices in slope-intercept form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-12x+3y=9 &\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad y=4x+3 \\\\\n6x+2y=8 &\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad y=-3x+4 \\\\\n-12x-9y=18 &\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad y=-\\frac{4}{3}x-2 \\\\\n6x+2y=-6 &\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad y=-3x-3 \\\\\n8x-2y=4 &\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad y=4x-2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe line $-12x+3y=9$ has both the same slope $4$ and the same $y$-intercept $3$ as the given line. It is the same line, so it is not a distinct parallel line.\n\nThe line $8x-2y=4$ has slope $4$ and $y$-intercept $-2$, different from $3$. Therefore, it is a distinct parallel line.\n\n$$\n8x-2y=4\n$$"] [:db/add "eb457b6a-7809-54b1-9e8e-4364b1ea37d2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "eb457b6a-7809-54b1-9e8e-4364b1ea37d2" :question/answer-fields "d242d468-6bb0-5247-9852-e908ca5d26f5"] [:db/ensure "eb457b6a-7809-54b1-9e8e-4364b1ea37d2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087687 :knowledge-point/questions "eb457b6a-7809-54b1-9e8e-4364b1ea37d2"] [:db/add "3bd93cf0-58ea-56ef-a91e-38fee93c71ce" :answer/id #uuid "3bd93cf0-58ea-56ef-a91e-38fee93c71ce"] [:db/add "3bd93cf0-58ea-56ef-a91e-38fee93c71ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3bd93cf0-58ea-56ef-a91e-38fee93c71ce" :answer/value "-10x-2y=10"] [:db/ensure "3bd93cf0-58ea-56ef-a91e-38fee93c71ce" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5e370ee7-7002-5ffc-911d-db3c2c7c1fc8" :answer/id #uuid "5e370ee7-7002-5ffc-911d-db3c2c7c1fc8"] [:db/add "5e370ee7-7002-5ffc-911d-db3c2c7c1fc8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5e370ee7-7002-5ffc-911d-db3c2c7c1fc8" :answer/value "3x-3y=12"] [:db/ensure "5e370ee7-7002-5ffc-911d-db3c2c7c1fc8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5c3a96ea-1e23-5c62-893e-d91625fe16bb" :answer/id #uuid "5c3a96ea-1e23-5c62-893e-d91625fe16bb"] [:db/add "5c3a96ea-1e23-5c62-893e-d91625fe16bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5c3a96ea-1e23-5c62-893e-d91625fe16bb" :answer/value "-